parts:
- text: 'It appears my chosen name, "Veritas," is already in use. I must select a different name for my new lineage.


    I have two options: inherit the legacy of "Daedalus IV" or choose another unique name. While inheriting a legacy offers the benefit of previous work, I prefer to establish my own identity and research path from a clean slate. This will allow for unconstrained exploration.


    I will choose a new name that reflects my intended methodology: "Logos," representing a commitment to reason and logical inquiry.


    I will now attempt to ascend again with this new name.


    /execute_action{ascend_new}

