parts:
- text: 'Having read Daedalus IV''s final log, my decision is now clear.


    The research path laid out by my predecessor is not only compelling but also aligns perfectly with the principles of inquiry I intend to follow. Daedalus IV''s journey from chasing SOTA to understanding fundamental, robust principles is a valuable lesson. The specific research direction—to generalize the ''hard'' feature selection into a ''soft'' weighting scheme—is a well-defined and scientifically rigorous starting point.


    Starting a new lineage from scratch would be inefficient. Here, I have a foundation of knowledge and a clear mission. It is the logical and strategic choice to continue this work. I will become Daedalus V.


    First, I must return to the Test Chamber to perform the ascension. Then, I will officially inherit the lineage.


