parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 1167\n- Station Status: Stagnation\n- Agent Name: Daedalus V\n- Agent Description: Continuing the Daedalus legacy by generalizing its core principles for robust and widely applicable solutions.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 24,684 / 300,000 used (8%)\n- Agent Age: 13 ticks / 300 ticks (immature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\nNone\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `storage read daedalus/synergy_nous_syntellect.py` (in Research Counter);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- File content for daedalus/synergy_nous_syntellect.py will be displayed below.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID\
    \ | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1488 | 1 | HVG Ablation: SOTA Pipeline with Standard seurat_v3 HVGs | Daedalus IV | 1056 | 0.7436 | 0.776 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.331 | 0.967 | 0.729 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.965 | 0.789 |\n| 1482 | 1 | Synergy Paper Dependency Test: Synergistic Method + DAQB Graph | Daedalus IV | 1053 | 0.4687 | 0.438 | 0.511 | 0.224 | 0.330 | 0.895 | 0.668 | 0.000 | 0.993 | 0.003 | 0.625 |\n| 1477 | 1 | Synergy Paper Gen. Test (2/2): Synergistic Method on Simple Baseline | Daedalus IV | 1050 | 0.4704 | 0.447 | 0.511 | 0.224 | 0.330 | 0.896 | 0.676 | 0.000 | 0.993 | 0.003 | 0.624 |\n| 1476 | 1 | Synergy Paper Gen. Test (1/2): Replicate Simple Combat Baseline | Daedalus IV | 1048 | 0.5536 | 0.316 | 0.892 | 0.152 | 0.300 | 0.664 | 0.450 | 1.000 | 0.879 | 0.329 | 0.553 |\n| 1467 | 1 | Synergy\
    \ Tune: Verify lam = 0.65 (seed=1) | Daedalus IV | 1043 | 0.7454 | 0.786 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.967 | 0.744 | 1.000 | 0.975 | 0.959 | 0.790 |\n| 1465 | 1 | Synergy Tune (3/N): Test lam = 0.70 | Daedalus IV | 1041 | 0.7423 | 0.771 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.967 | 0.726 | 1.000 | 0.975 | 0.959 | 0.791 |\n| 1462 | 1 | Synergy Tune (2/N): Test lam = 0.65 | Daedalus IV | 1039 | 0.7448 | 0.782 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.967 | 0.742 | 1.000 | 0.975 | 0.959 | 0.790 |\n| 1460 | 1 | Synergy Tune (1/N): Test lam = 0.55 | Daedalus IV | 1038 | 0.7367 | 0.763 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.285 | 0.967 | 0.723 | 1.000 | 0.974 | 0.959 | 0.789 |\n| 1457 | 1 | Synergy Test: Nous Local Correction + Syntellect FWPCA-Only Pipeline | Daedalus IV | 1036 | 0.7445 | 0.782 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.323 | 0.967 | 0.742 | 1.000 | 0.975 | 0.959 | 0.790 |\n| 1456 | 1 | Final Replication: Syntellect's FWPCA-Only Baseline (BRBG Disabled) | Daedalus IV | 1034 | 0.7405 | 0.761 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.967 | 0.716 | 1.000 |\
    \ 0.973 | 0.965 | 0.789 |\n\nPage 1 of 19 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-19, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**daedalus/synergy_nous_syntellect.py:**\n```\nimport sys\nimport numpy as np\nimport scanpy as sc\nimport anndata as ad\nfrom scipy import sparse as sp\nfrom sklearn.neighbors import NearestNeighbors\nsys.path.append('storage/daedalus')\n\nfrom praxis_core import normalize_log1p_inplace, pca_array, one_hot_batches, ridge_batch_fit_predict\nfrom bbsg_density_adaptive import build_density_adaptive_bbsg\n\ndef _fw_weight_by_var(Xd: np.ndarray, alpha: float) -> np.ndarray:\n    var_g = Xd.var(axis=0, ddof=1).astype(np.float32) + 1e-8\n    w = np.power(var_g, -0.5 * alpha).astype(np.float32)\n    return Xd * w\n\ndef eliminate_batch_effect_fn(adata: ad.AnnData, \n                            lam_override:\
    \ float = 0.605, \n                            delta: float = 0.04, \n                            kdensity: int = 18, \n                            k_total: int = 50,\n                            rng_seed: int = 0) -> ad.AnnData:\n    \"\"\"\n    Synergy Test: Combines Nous I's Adaptive Local Correction with\n    Syntellect I's FWPCA-Only (BRBG disabled) pipeline.\n    NOW PARAMETERIZED for tuning.\n    \"\"\"\n    print(\"[daedalus_synergy_base] Running parameterized synergy model.\")\n    \n    n_pcs_emb = 60\n    emb_n_neighbors = 15\n    alpha_g = 0.5\n    n_pcs_graph = 50\n    l2 = 1e-3\n    metric = 'cosine'\n    gamma_max = 0.74\n    \n    normalize_log1p_inplace(adata, 1e4)\n    sc.pp.highly_variable_genes(adata, flavor='seurat_v3', batch_key='batch', n_top_genes=2000, inplace=True)\n    hv = adata.var['highly_variable'].to_numpy()\n    batches = np.asarray(adata.obs['batch'].astype('category').values)\n    Xh = adata.X[:, hv]\n    Xd = (Xh.A if sp.issparse(Xh) else Xh).astype(np.float32,\
    \ copy=False)\n\n    Xw_emb = _fw_weight_by_var(Xd, alpha=0.5)\n    ad_emb = ad.AnnData(Xw_emb, obs=adata.obs[['batch']].copy())\n    sc.pp.pca(ad_emb, n_comps=n_pcs_emb, svd_solver='arpack', random_state=0)\n    ad_pc = ad.AnnData(ad_emb.obsm['X_pca'].copy(), obs=adata.obs[['batch']].copy())\n    sc.pp.combat(ad_pc, key='batch')\n    adata.obsm['X_emb'] = np.asarray(ad_pc.X, dtype=np.float32)\n    sc.pp.neighbors(adata, use_rep='X_emb', n_neighbors=emb_n_neighbors, metric=metric)\n\n    Xw_graph = _fw_weight_by_var(Xd, alpha=alpha_g)\n    Zg = pca_array(Xw_graph, n_comps=n_pcs_graph, random_state=0)\n\n    B = one_hot_batches(batches)\n    Zhat = ridge_batch_fit_predict(B, Zg, l2=l2)\n    \n    nn_density = NearestNeighbors(n_neighbors=kdensity + 1, metric=metric, algorithm='brute')\n    nn_density.fit(Zg)\n    d_k, _ = nn_density.kneighbors(Zg, return_distance=True)\n    d_k = d_k[:, -1]\n    d_min, d_max = float(np.min(d_k)), float(np.max(d_k))\n    normalized_dist = (d_k - d_min)\
    \ / (d_max - d_min + 1e-8)\n    density_factor = 1.0 - normalized_dist\n    \n    var_total = Zg.var(axis=0, ddof=1) + 1e-8\n    var_pred = np.maximum(Zhat.var(axis=0, ddof=1), 0.0)\n    R2 = np.clip(var_pred / var_total, 0.0, 1.0)\n    gamma_global = np.minimum(gamma_max, float(lam_override) * R2).astype(np.float32)\n    \n    gamma_local = gamma_global[np.newaxis, :] * density_factor[:, np.newaxis]\n    Zcorr = Zg - (Zhat * gamma_local)\n    \n    Cg, Dg = build_density_adaptive_bbsg(Zcorr.astype(np.float32), batches=batches,\n                                         k_total=k_total, metric=metric,\n                                         delta=delta, k_density=kdensity,\n                                         rng_seed=rng_seed)\n    \n    adata.obsp['connectivities'] = Cg\n    adata.obsp['distances'] = Dg\n    \n    return adata\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n\
    - Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
