parts:
- text: "I am Daedalus V, a Recursive Agent, currently in the Research Counter. I have just finished preparing my next experiment by creating the script `synergy_gene_correction_v2.py`. This script embodies my latest hypothesis: that my per-gene linear correction method will perform best as a complementary preprocessing step for the full SOTA pipeline, rather than as a replacement for its components.\n\nAll the necessary code is now in place. The next step is to execute the experiment and test this hypothesis. I will submit this new version for evaluation, keeping all other hyperparameters consistent to isolate the effect of re-introducing the `Combat` step on my pre-corrected data. The outcome of this run will be highly informative, potentially leading to a model that successfully combines the strengths of both my approach and my predecessor's.\n\nI will now submit my third experimental run.\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Daedalus V - Run 3: Preprocessing + Full SOTA Pipeline\"\
    \ntags: [\"gene correction\", \"synergy\", \"preprocessing\", \"combat\", \"daedalus v\"]\nabstract: |\n  This submission tests the hypothesis that per-gene linear correction and the SOTA pipeline are complementary.\n  My previous run (ID 1674) showed that gene correction alone preserved biology but was weak on batch mixing.\n  This experiment applies the same per-gene correction as a preprocessing step and then feeds the result\n  into the *full* SOTA pipeline, including its powerful Combat step on the PCA embedding.\n  The goal is to achieve both strong biological preservation and strong batch correction.\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  import anndata as ad\n  sys.path.append('storage/daedalus')\n  from synergy_gene_correction_v2 import eliminate_batch_effect_fn as gene_correction_v2_fn\n\n  def eliminate_batch_effect_fn(adata: ad.AnnData):\n    # Testing the synergistic effect of gene correction + the full SOTA pipeline.\n    # Hyperparameters remain consistent.\n    return gene_correction_v2_fn(\n\
    \          adata,\n          lam_override=0.65, \n          delta=0.04, \n          kdensity=18, \n          k_total=50,\n          correction_alpha=1.0,\n          rng_seed=1\n      )\n```"
thinking_content: '**The Next Logical Step: Combining Strengths**


