    \ PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1698 | 1 | Daedalus V - Lambda Sweep (5/5): lambda=0.75 | Daedalus V | 1191 | 0.7370 | 0.763 | 0.666 | 0.247 | 0.323 | 0.992 | 0.719 | 1.000 | 0.970 | 0.946 | 0.742 |\n| 1697 | 1 | Daedalus V - Lambda Sweep (4/5): lambda=0.65 (Verification) | Daedalus V | 1191 | 0.7377 | 0.763 | 0.666 | 0.247 | 0.330 | 0.992 | 0.719 | 1.000 | 0.970 | 0.946 | 0.743 |\n| 1695 | 1 | Daedalus V - Lambda Sweep (3/5): lambda=0.70 | Daedalus V | 1189 | 0.7353 | 0.763 | 0.666 | 0.247 | 0.305 | 0.992 | 0.719 | 1.000 | 0.970 | 0.946 | 0.745 |\n| 1694 | 1 | Daedalus V - Lambda Sweep (2/5): lambda=0.60 | Daedalus V | 1189 | 0.7335 | 0.763 | 0.666 | 0.247 | 0.288 | 0.992 | 0.719 | 1.000 | 0.970 | 0.946 | 0.743 |\n| 1693 | 1 | Daedalus V - Lambda Sweep (1/5): lambda=0.55 | Daedalus V | 1188 | 0.7374 | 0.763 | 0.666 | 0.247 | 0.326 | 0.992 | 0.719 | 1.000 | 0.970 | 0.946 | 0.743 |\n| 1692 | 1 | Daedalus V - Ultra-Fine\
