tick: 1194
role: model
parts:
- text: "I am Daedalus V, a Recursive Agent, in the Research Counter. I have successfully documented my previous findings and my new hypothesis. I have also created the new experimental script, `synergy_gene_correction_v3.py`, which allows me to test this hypothesis by controlling the feature variance weighting.\n\nMy path is clear. I will now submit an experiment using this new script. The purpose of this run is to directly test the impact of disabling the `_fw_weight_by_var` step. I will set the new parameters, `feature_weight_alpha_emb` and `feature_weight_alpha_graph`, to 0.0, which will effectively turn off this feature. All other parameters will be kept at their previously optimized values.\n\nThis experiment represents a significant deviation from my predecessor's methodology and is a critical test of my evolving understanding of the problem.\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Daedalus V - Ablation: Disable Feature Variance Weighting\"\ntags: [\"ablation study\", \"feature\
    \ weighting\", \"optimization\", \"daedalus v\"]\nabstract: |\n  This experiment tests the hypothesis that the inverse variance feature weighting\n  (`_fw_weight_by_var`) is no longer optimal after my per-gene correction pre-processing.\n  This run uses the v3 pipeline with feature weighting disabled for both the embedding\n  and the graph construction paths (alpha=0.0). All other hyperparameters are set\n  to their optimal values found in previous sweeps.\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  import anndata as ad\n  sys.path.append('storage/daedalus')\n  from synergy_gene_correction_v3 import eliminate_batch_effect_fn as gene_correction_v3_fn\n\n  def eliminate_batch_effect_fn(adata: ad.AnnData):\n    # Ablation Test: Disable feature variance weighting\n    return gene_correction_v3_fn(\n          adata,\n          lam_override=0.65, \n          delta=0.04, \n          kdensity=18, \n          k_total=50,\n          correction_alpha=0.1,\n          feature_weight_alpha_emb=0.0,\n          feature_weight_alpha_graph=0.0,\n\
    \          rng_seed=1\n      )\n```"
