    | 1701 | 1 | Daedalus V - Ablation: Disable Feature Variance Weighting | Daedalus V | 1194 | 0.7303 | 0.717 | 0.687 | 0.216 | 0.350 | 0.948 | 0.682 | 1.000 | 0.965 | 0.945 | 0.794 |


