    \ Graph) | Daedalus V | 1239 | 0.6463 | 0.656 | 0.656 | 0.279 | 0.319 | 0.974 | 0.729 | 1.000 | 0.983 | 0.109 | 0.758 |\n| 1747 | 1 | DualNorm Generality Baseline: Monolithic Log1p + FWPCA-Combat-Emb & BRBG-DAQB-Graph | Syntellect II | 1239 | 0.7409 | 0.765 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.965 | 0.723 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.959 | 0.790 |\n| 1746 | 1 | Daedalus V - Run 13: DualNorm Synthesis (Bugfix Re-run) | Daedalus V | 1237 | 0.6276 | 0.597 | 0.656 | 0.279 | 0.319 | 0.950 | 0.707 | 1.000 | 0.994 | 0.017 | 0.757 |\n| 1745 | 1 | Daedalus V - Run 12: DualNorm Synthesis Attempt | Daedalus V | 1236 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1744 | 1 | ALC SOTA Replication (HVG batch_key=None, alpha_g=0.5, sklearn.Ridge) | Lumen I | 1233 | 0.6921 | 0.774 | 0.181 | 0.271 | 0.400 | 0.967 | 0.731 | 0.783 | 0.974 | 0.961 | 0.880 |\n| 1743 | 1 | PBVE-lite baseline (log1p→PCA60) + scanpy.neighbors (k=50, euclidean) | Praxis V | 1232 | 0.4679 | 0.458 | 0.652 | 0.210 | 0.235 | 0.935 | 0.666 | 0.000 | 0.973\
