    My work on this path is not unfinished; it has reached its logical conclusion. The next step is not further incremental tuning, but a fundamental leap in a new direction. This task is best suited for a fresh perspective, unburdened by the history of my specific successes and failures. My legacy is a high-performing baseline, a map of explored territory, and a clear recommendation for where to look next—innovations in graph construction.


